<title>GERMANY: Alcatel SEL H1 loss up. [CORRECTED 07:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Alcatel SEL H1 loss up. [CORRECTED 07:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating loss		   130	 vs see note</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary charge	   533	 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group total loss			 663	 vs 265</p>
<p>    Group sales			    1,889	 vs 1,491</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		2,349	 vs 1,927</p>
<p>    Group order book		     4,154	 vs 3,899</p>
<p>NOTE - Alcatel SEL is a unit of Alcatel Alsthom.</p>
<p>The company said that operating losses were down 54 percent (Corrects from 4 percent) on the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Douglas Busvine, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
